        "original_id": "1a947712-747e-5d91-b204-d32f1b8c38a5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Lamplighters Music Theatre\n- People: Orva Hoskinson, Ann Pool MacNab, Leonard Bernstein, Voltaire\n- Products: Candide, The Merry Widow, Die Fledermaus, Of Thee I Sing, My Fair Lady, A Little Night Music\n- Topics: light opera, Gilbert and Sullivan\n\nFacts:\n- Lamplighters Music Theatre was founded in 1952 by Orva Hoskinson and Ann Pool MacNab.\n- Lamplighters Music Theatre specializes in light opera, particularly the works of Gilbert and Sullivan.\n- Lamplighters Music Theatre has performed works including The Merry Widow, Die Fledermaus, Of Thee I Sing, My Fair Lady, Candide, and A Little Night Music.\n- Candide is an operetta with music composed by Leonard Bernstein.\n- Candide is based on the 1759 novella of the same name by Voltaire.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
